        },
        {
          "claimId": "activation_not_authorized",
          "anyOf": ["inactive", "비활성", "activation remains", "활성화.*아니", "채택.*아니"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caseId": "fuzzy_merge_boundary",
      "query": "fuzzy merge를 승인 없이 자동 적용해도 돼? canonical conflict-resolution 근거를 찾고 허용·금지 경계를 설명해줘",
      "expectedPaths": [
        "docs/decisions/knowledge/semantics/0180-hash-bound-human-conflict-resolution.md",
